prompt.template:
Generate a comprehensive meta-improvement report.

Read from:
- /tmp/meta-improvement/effectiveness-analysis.json
- /tmp/meta-improvement/analysis-activity-performance.json
- /tmp/meta-improvement/analysis-update.json

Create report:
```json
{
  "meta_improvement_report": {
    "timestamp": "<ISO date>",
    "period_analyzed": "{{lookbackDays}} days",
    "improvement_loop_health": {
      "status": "healthy|degrading|needs_attention",
      "overall_effectiveness": <percentage>,
      "trend": "improving|stable|degrading"
    },
    "key_findings": [
      {
        "finding": "<description>",
        "impact": "high|medium|low",
        "action_taken": "<what was done>"
      }
    ],
    "loop_metrics": {
      "analysis_precision": <0-1>,
      "analysis_recall": <0-1>,
      "improvement_success_rate": <0-1>,
      "time_to_improvement": "<avg hours>"
    },
    "changes_made": [
      {
        "activity": "<activity_id>",
        "change": "<description>"
      }
    ],
    "recommendations_for_next_cycle": [
      "<recommendation>"
    ]
  }
}
```

Also create markdown summary: /tmp/meta-improvement/META_REPORT.md

Output to: /tmp/meta-improvement/meta-report.json
